WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.230 --> 00:00:04.120
Speaker 1: Moving on to other things, how
about covid?

00:00:04.120 --> 00:00:07.410
Right, covid horrible all across the country.

00:00:07.410 --> 00:00:13.810
But as usual, I want to start right down here
in my home state of Florida where, as we know.

00:00:13.810 --> 00:00:18.580
Our trump loving Republican Governor De Santurce.

00:00:18.580 --> 00:00:24.869
Has said and they doubled down again on this
on Friday, that any school district.

00:00:24.869 --> 00:00:30.170
That implements a massive mandate, which is
a growing number of them at this point, we

00:00:30.170 --> 00:00:32.150
may cut off your funding.

00:00:32.150 --> 00:00:37.070
Now, according to reports on Friday, and this
really angered me because these reports are

00:00:37.070 --> 00:00:42.210
totally inaccurate, they said that DeSantis
had backed off.

00:00:42.210 --> 00:00:49.630
His claim to cut the salaries of administrators
who go along with these mass mandates, instead,

00:00:49.630 --> 00:00:54.550
what actually happened was you had DeSantis
D.A. spokesperson Christina Pusha, who came

00:00:54.550 --> 00:01:01.059
out and said, we're going to leave it to the
to the school boards to voluntarily give up

00:01:01.059 --> 00:01:05.700
their salaries for doing this once we cut
their funding.

00:01:05.700 --> 00:01:08.010
So they didn't exactly back off it.

00:01:08.010 --> 00:01:11.140
They just realized, oh, wait, we actually
don't have the authority to do it.

00:01:11.140 --> 00:01:14.750
So we're going to explain how it can be done,
but we're still going to cut off your funding,

00:01:14.750 --> 00:01:16.650
they said.

00:01:16.650 --> 00:01:21.610
So over the weekend, the Biden administration
came out, did the right thing and said, hold

00:01:21.610 --> 00:01:23.290
up now.

00:01:23.290 --> 00:01:24.870
Any school district in the state of Florida.

00:01:24.870 --> 00:01:29.240
Oh, and before I even get into that, Biden
actually called some of the districts and

00:01:29.240 --> 00:01:31.880
thanked them for putting mass mandates in
place.

00:01:31.880 --> 00:01:33.250
So that was a good job as well.

00:01:33.250 --> 00:01:35.610
Biden is not backing down off this.

00:01:35.610 --> 00:01:38.450
He is making sure that these people know he
has their back.

00:01:38.450 --> 00:01:44.110
And so after the phone calls, his administration
came out and said anywhere in the state of

00:01:44.110 --> 00:01:49.320
Florida, if they cut off your funding for
having a massive mandate, we got your back

00:01:49.320 --> 00:01:51.790
and we'll make sure you get the funding.

00:01:51.790 --> 00:01:57.610
If we have to, we will use some of these covid
emergency funds to fund your school district,

00:01:57.610 --> 00:02:02.820
to pay your salaries, to do whatever we need
to do, because we're not going to let this

00:02:02.820 --> 00:02:05.560
Florida tyrant.

00:02:05.560 --> 00:02:13.420
Tell you to make these horrible decisions
that could put your kids in danger.

00:02:13.420 --> 00:02:17.989
Across the state, in county after county,
including counties that defied to Santas and

00:02:17.989 --> 00:02:24.959
did put mass mandates in place, we are seeing
record numbers of teachers, administrators

00:02:24.959 --> 00:02:31.770
and students out with covid or having to quarantine
because of exposure.

00:02:31.770 --> 00:02:36.510
Broward County, I think the number was, what,
440 out?

00:02:36.510 --> 00:02:42.730
You also had four teachers in Broward County,
all died last week within hours of each other

00:02:42.730 --> 00:02:45.510
from covid.

00:02:45.510 --> 00:02:51.890
Reopening these schools with no mask mandates
at all, no vaccine mandates for teachers or

00:02:51.890 --> 00:02:59.340
administrators was one of the biggest mistakes
we have seen this this state do.

00:02:59.340 --> 00:03:01.450
You know, last year.

00:03:01.450 --> 00:03:07.980
They started doing away with the virtual learning,
with the distance learning, forcing most people

00:03:07.980 --> 00:03:12.970
to go brick and mortar this year, distance
learning was not even an option.

00:03:12.970 --> 00:03:19.189
It was brick and mortar or you become a full
time home schooler.

00:03:19.189 --> 00:03:21.219
And that's why we're seeing so many problems.

00:03:21.219 --> 00:03:23.859
We we didn't we didn't have the option.

00:03:23.859 --> 00:03:26.540
We weren't given a choice.

00:03:26.540 --> 00:03:30.650
The only choice we have is whether or not
we personally send our kids to school wearing

00:03:30.650 --> 00:03:33.930
a mask, which, yes, I have done.

00:03:33.930 --> 00:03:37.180
When I dropped them off, they have their masks
on when I pick them up, they still have their

00:03:37.180 --> 00:03:38.180
masks on.

00:03:38.180 --> 00:03:43.260
I have no idea what happens all throughout
the day, though, with those masks.

00:03:43.260 --> 00:03:48.099
Are they taking it off as soon as I drop them
off, are they putting it on when they see

00:03:48.099 --> 00:03:49.099
me walking up?

00:03:49.099 --> 00:03:53.379
I don't know and I don't know what any of
the other children are doing there either,

00:03:53.379 --> 00:03:57.329
except I do know when I go to pick them up
in the afternoon, there's only a handful of

00:03:57.329 --> 00:03:58.550
kids wearing masks.

00:03:58.550 --> 00:04:05.769
And I've only seen one staff member wearing
a mask when I've gone to pick up my children.

00:04:05.769 --> 00:04:07.900
One.

00:04:07.900 --> 00:04:10.609
This situation is about to become so much
worse.

00:04:10.609 --> 00:04:16.560
We're now a full week down, hundreds of people
throughout the state as a result of exposure

00:04:16.560 --> 00:04:21.290
at school, either on quarantine or.

00:04:21.290 --> 00:04:24.030
Out with covid.

00:04:24.030 --> 00:04:29.470
And it's going to get worse as time goes on,
because we're not protecting our kids, DeSanto

00:04:29.470 --> 00:04:31.020
said he left the decision up to the parents.

00:04:31.020 --> 00:04:34.530
Well, the parents aren't making the right
decision here.

00:04:34.530 --> 00:04:39.030
And they're letting their kids get exposed,
who then expose other children, all we have

00:04:39.030 --> 00:04:40.420
to do is have our kids wear masks.

00:04:40.420 --> 00:04:43.390
They had to do it all throughout the school
year last year.

00:04:43.390 --> 00:04:47.980
You know, many problems it caused.

00:04:47.980 --> 00:04:49.440
None.

00:04:49.440 --> 00:04:54.480
There were no reports of any child being injured
from having to wear a mask.

00:04:54.480 --> 00:05:45.880
There was not mass hospitalizations because
children's oxygen levels dropped due to wearing

00:05:45.880 --> 00:06:00.780
a mask.

